Today is Tuesday.
It is evening.
What time is it now?
It is half past five.
I go to the gym.
This is my new routine.
I come here on Tuesday and Thursday.
I do not go to the gym every day.
I enter the gym.
There are many people here.
I run.
After that, I do hard exercises.
This is very difficult.
But I am happy.
Good health is important.
Therefore, I always follow this routine.
Now it is half past six.
My workout is finished.
I am tired.
Now I go home.
